class.description:
For audio that comes without a container, a frame at a time: a PC's sound sent over the network. Each [method decode] takes one packet and returns the stereo frames it decoded to, resampled to the output rate. There is no clock: the caller plays them (an [AudioStreamGenerator]) at their time.
[codeblock]
var decoder := AudioPacketDecoder.new()
decoder.open("aac")
var frames := decoder.decode(adts_frame)  # PackedVector2Array at decoder.get_output_rate()
[/codeblock]
